model r1
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place sav: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input w: date
input w3: date
input pay: money PLN
move pw: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
move ps: transfers
  on w3
  leg cash from world to sav amount pay
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "s"
  w = 2026-03-10 "s"
  w3 = 2026-03-10 "s"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[sav] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
ask a0: bal(konto, 2026-03-07)
ask b_before: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-06
ask b_on: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-07
ask b_after: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-08
ask b_same: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-10
ask o_other: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w3 = 2026-03-20
ask o_other2: bal(sav, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-20
ask o_out: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2027-02-01
ask o_pre: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2025-12-01
ask fl: flows(konto, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-08
ask flin: flows(konto, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-07
ask flm: flows(pw, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-08
ask ex: explain bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-08
ask ck: check bal(konto, 2026-03-07) == bal(konto, 2026-03-01) with w = 2026-03-08
ask two: bal(konto, 2026-03-07), bal(sav, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-08
ask cnt: count(m in transfers over 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-08
ask sm: sum(m.cash.amount for m in transfers over 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-08
ask pr: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) from 2026-03-01 with w = 2026-03-08
ask pr2: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) from 2026-03-01 with w = 2026-02-20
ask mn: min(bal(konto, d) for d in 2026-03-06 .. 2026-03-09 step 1 day) with w = 2026-03-08
ask each: bal(konto, d) for d in [2026-03-07, 2026-03-08, 2026-03-09] with w = 2026-03-08
ask both: bal(konto, 2026-03-07) with w = 2026-03-08, w3 = 2026-03-09
